From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maxim Stepanov <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 01:05:19 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] strip: remove residual telemetry surfaces (v1.10.3/v1.11.3)

Strips telemetry::event! sites and dangling telemetry deps that appeared in new upstream
code (git_ui diffs, remote/remote_server, agent_ui inline/terminal codegen assistants).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
